msgstr "安全"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:113
msgid "in use"
msgstr "使用中"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:123
msgid "What these files are"
msgstr "これらのファイルについて"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:126
msgid "Raw audio, one piece at a time"
msgstr "元音声を、一つずつ"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:127
msgid ""
"Every sentence is narrated separately and saved uncompressed, then "
"stitched into chapters and packed into the <code>.m4b</code>. The raw "
"pieces stay behind afterwards."
msgstr "一文ずつ別々にナレーションして無圧縮で保存し、それを章にまとめて <code>.m4b</code> に収めます。元の断片はそのあとも残ります。"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:130
msgid "All they buy you is a shortcut"
msgstr "得られるのは近道だけです"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:131
msgid ""
"While they exist, changing a voice setting re-narrates only the parts "
"that changed — minutes instead of hours. Once you are happy with a book, "
"that shortcut is worth nothing."
msgstr "これらがある間は、声の設定を変えても変わった部分だけを読み直すので、何時間もではなく数分で済みます。仕上がりに満足したあとは、その近道に価値はありません。"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:134
msgid "You keep everything that matters"
msgstr "大事なものはすべて残ります"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:135
msgid ""
"The finished audiobook, your ebook, your voices, your section choices — "
"untouched. You can always narrate the book again from scratch."
msgstr "完成したオーディオブック、電子書籍、声、セクションの選択はそのままです。いつでも最初から本をナレーションし直せます。"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:145
msgid "Free them the moment a book finishes"
msgstr "本が完成したらすぐ削除する"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:146
msgid "On — a finished book now cleans up after itself."
msgstr "オン — 完成した本が自分で後片付けをします。"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:147
msgid ""
"Off, so nothing is ever deleted without you. Turn it on and every "
"finished book cleans up after itself."
msgstr "オフなので、あなたの知らないうちに何かが消えることはありません。オンにすると、完成した本がすべて自分で後片付けをします。"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:168
msgid "Left switched off."
msgstr "オフのままにしました。"

