msgstr[0] "%(n)s 冊分のナレーション元音声を削除します。完成したオーディオブック、電子書籍、声はそのままです。"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:207
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(n)s of these stopped part-way through. Its working files are what let "
"it carry on — delete them and those sections are narrated again from the "
"beginning."
