#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:10
msgid ""
"A voice is one short recording. About ten seconds is enough — the engine "
"copies its timbre and reads your whole book in it."
msgstr "声とは短い録音のことです。十秒ほどあれば十分で、エンジンがその声色を写し取り、本を丸ごとその声で読み上げます。"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:17
msgid "Which language's narrators to show"
msgstr "どの言語の語り手を表示するか"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:24
#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:47
msgid "Add a voice"
msgstr "声を追加"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:36
msgid ""
"These narrators can't be auditioned yet: the model for this language "
"isn't on this computer."
msgstr "これらの語り手はまだ試聴できません。この言語のモデルがこのパソコンにありません。"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:37
msgid "Install it in Settings"
msgstr "設定からインストール"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:43
msgid ""
"<b>Use only voices you have the right to use.</b> Your own recording, or "
"one whose owner has agreed to this. Clips never leave this computer — but"
" that is not the same thing as permission."
msgstr "<b>使う権利のある声だけをお使いください。</b>自分で録音したもの、または持ち主が同意したものです。クリップがこのパソコンから出ることはありませんが、それは許可を得ていることとは別の話です。"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:51
msgid "Name it"
msgstr "名前を付ける"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:52
msgid "Warm baritone"
msgstr "温かみのあるバリトン"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:55
msgid "Language it speaks"
msgstr "話す言語"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:63
msgid "Reference clip"
msgstr "参照クリップ"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:71
msgid ""
"WAV, MP3, FLAC, M4A, MP4, OGG, Opus, AAC or WebM — converted to WAV on "
"the way in. Ten seconds of clear, unaccompanied speech works best."
msgstr ""
"WAV、MP3、FLAC、M4A、MP4、OGG、Opus、AAC、WebM に対応し、取り込み時に WAV "
"へ変換します。伴奏のない明瞭な音声が十秒あるのが最適です。"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:72
msgid ""
"The language decides which books can be read in this voice, and which "
"sentence the audition reads back. It is not guessed from the recording."
msgstr "言語によって、この声で読める本と、試聴で読み上げる文が決まります。録音から推測することはありません。"

